>Bamboo is softer and smoother than cotton. It feels like a blend of cashmere and silk, thanks to its round and smooth fibers.<\/p>"}},"item_9BqNea":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"picto-coupon","custom_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/20-love-heart-outline.gif","mobile_icon_width":80,"icon_width":80,"icon_background_type":"none","icon_background":"","icon_color":"","title":"Silky smooth and hypoallergenic","content":"<p>Bamboo is perfect  for sensitive skin. Bamboo doesn't cause skin irritation, itching or scratching. <\/p>"}},"item_7recRV":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"picto-coupon","custom_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1240-bacteria-outline.gif","mobile_icon_width":80,"icon_width":80,"icon_background_type":"none","icon_background":"","icon_color":"","title":"Less unpleasant odours and bacteria","content":"<p>Bamboo's natural antimicrobial properties prevent the growth of bacteria and other microbes that can cause unpleasant odors. Stay fresh and odor-free all day long, without the need for harsh chemicals or synthetic antimicrobial treatments.<\/p>"}},"item_DC9zgj":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"picto-coupon","custom_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/437-environment-eco-care-outline_1.gif","mobile_icon_width":80,"icon_width":80,"icon_background_type":"none","icon_background":"","icon_color":"","title":"Environmentally friendly","content":"<p>Bamboo grows extremely fast with minimal water consumption, it absorbs carbon dioxide and releases 35% more oxygen than other trees.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["item_UMxRTW","item_9BqNea","item_7recRV","item_DC9zgj"],"name":"Text with icons","settings":{"full_width":true,"stack_on_mobile":true,"title":"Bamboo is better for your skin and the environment","heading_tag":"h5","text_alignment":"center","icon_spacing":"medium","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}},"text_with_icons_rGGHzx":{"type":"text-with-icons","blocks":{"item_ta6K3r":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"picto-coupon","custom_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/443-tree-outline.gif","mobile_icon_width":80,"icon_width":80,"icon_background_type":"none","icon_background":"","icon_color":"","title":"Organic origin","content":"<p>Bamboo grows using only rainwater. It doesn't require any pesticides or insecticides, making it better for the environment.<\/p>"}},"item_Ypa6Vm":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"picto-coupon","custom_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/447-water-drop-outline_1.gif","mobile_icon_width":80,"icon_width":80,"icon_background_type":"none","icon_background":"","icon_color":"","title":"Moisture absorption","content":"<p>Bamboo's exceptional moisture absorption is 2 times better than cotton. Its ability to wick away moisture helps keep your skin healthy and fresh. <\/p>"}},"item_ENeR3z":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"picto-coupon","custom_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/451-electric-power-outline.gif","mobile_icon_width":80,"icon_width":80,"icon_background_type":"none","icon_background":"","icon_color":"","title":"Anti-static","content":"<p>Bamboo's natural anti-static properties make it more comfortable to wear and less likely to cling to your skin or cause annoying static shocks.<\/p>"}},"item_N76BDr":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"picto-coupon","custom_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/442-thermometer-morph-outline.gif","mobile_icon_width":80,"icon_width":80,"icon_background_type":"none","icon_background":"","icon_color":"","title":"Body temperature regulation","content":"<p>Bamboo helps regulate your body temperature and keep you comfortable in any weather.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["item_ta6K3r","item_Ypa6Vm","item_ENeR3z","item_N76BDr"],"name":"Text with icons","settings":{"full_width":true,"stack_on_mobile":true,"title":"","heading_tag":"h5","text_alignment":"center","icon_spacing":"medium","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}},"media_with_text_G9F8jn":{"type":"media-with-text","blocks":{"image_Pd7PxE":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_im